{
  "v": 6,
  "id": "011f1969-5765-478c-adc9-4581c81d50d6",
  "title": "3. 과업의 수행 방법론 — 성과관리 및 지표 필터링",
  "canvas": {
    "w": 1280,
    "h": 905
  },
  "source": {
    "kind": "kg-html",
    "html": "<section class=\"kg-slide kg-root\" data-screen-label=\"지표 필터링형\">\n  <header class=\"kg-header\">\n    <div class=\"kg-header__media\"></div>\n    <div class=\"kg-header__num kg-section-num\">03</div>\n    <div class=\"kg-header__divider\"></div>\n    <div class=\"kg-header__titles\">\n      <div class=\"kg-section-title\">과업의 수행 방법론</div>\n      <div class=\"kg-section-sub\">성과관리 · 성과지표 필터링</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"kg-chapter-tab\">\n      <span class=\"kg-chapter-tab__roman\">III</span>\n      <span class=\"kg-chapter-tab__sep\"></span>\n      <span class=\"kg-chapter-tag\">추진방안 및 관리계획</span>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"kg-msgband\"><span class=\"kg-msgband__mark\"></span>\n    <p class=\"kg-message\">전사 전략목표의 하향 전개와 현업 실행과제의 상향 제안을 접합하는 중간 접합 방식(Middle Up-Down)으로 성과지표를 도출하고, 중요성·타당성 2단 평가로 걸러 유지·보완·유보·삭제를 판정</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"kg-body-area\">\n    <div class=\"main\">\n\n      <!-- ================= 좌 ================= -->\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"kg-subtopic\">성과지표 도출과 2단 필터링</div>\n        <div class=\"col__b\">\n\n          <div class=\"card\" style=\"flex:0 0 auto;\">\n            <div class=\"card__h\">\n              <span class=\"card__n\" data-kg-role=\"num\">1</span>\n              <span class=\"card__t\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">중간 접합 방식에 따른 지표 도출</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card__b\" style=\"height:138px;\">\n              <div class=\"svgbox\">\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 140\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n                  <g font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-500)\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                    <text x=\"222\" y=\"13\">하향 전개</text>\n                    <text x=\"222\" y=\"134\">상향 제안</text>\n                  </g>\n                  <g stroke=\"var(--blue-500)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\">\n                    <path d=\"M192 24 C228 24 226 58 250 58\"></path>\n                    <path d=\"M192 116 C228 116 226 82 250 82\"></path>\n                    <path d=\"M396 70 H418\"></path>\n                  </g>\n                  <g fill=\"var(--blue-500)\">\n                    <path d=\"M248 53 L258 58 L248 63 z\"></path>\n                    <path d=\"M248 77 L258 82 L248 87 z\"></path>\n                    <path d=\"M416 65 L426 70 L416 75 z\"></path>\n                  </g>\n\n                  <rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"188\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\"></rect>\n                  <text data-slot=\"top\" x=\"98\" y=\"29\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">전사 전략목표·전략방향</text>\n\n                  <rect x=\"4\" y=\"96\" width=\"188\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\"></rect>\n                  <text data-slot=\"bot\" x=\"98\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">현업 실행과제·업무단위</text>\n\n                  <rect x=\"260\" y=\"40\" width=\"134\" height=\"60\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--navy-800)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></rect>\n                  <text data-slot=\"mid1\" x=\"327\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">지표 후보</text>\n                  <text data-slot=\"mid2\" x=\"327\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">조정·접합</text>\n\n                  <rect x=\"426\" y=\"40\" width=\"130\" height=\"60\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\"></rect>\n                  <text data-slot=\"out\" x=\"491\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">성과지표 후보군</text>\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"card__h\">\n              <span class=\"card__n\" data-kg-role=\"num\">2</span>\n              <span class=\"card__t\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">중요성·타당성 2단 평가 (항목별 20%)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card__b\">\n              <div class=\"filters\">\n                <div class=\"fl\">\n                  <div class=\"fl__h\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">중요성 평가</div>\n                  <div class=\"fl__b\">\n                    <div class=\"fr\"><span class=\"fr__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">전략연계성</span><span class=\"fr__w\" data-kg-role=\"label\">20%</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"fr\"><span class=\"fr__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">업무대표성</span><span class=\"fr__w\" data-kg-role=\"label\">20%</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"fr\"><span class=\"fr__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">행동 영향력</span><span class=\"fr__w\" data-kg-role=\"label\">20%</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"fr\"><span class=\"fr__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">시의적절성</span><span class=\"fr__w\" data-kg-role=\"label\">20%</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"fr\"><span class=\"fr__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">성과파급효과</span><span class=\"fr__w\" data-kg-role=\"label\">20%</span></div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"fl\">\n                  <div class=\"fl__h\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">타당성 평가</div>\n                  <div class=\"fl__b\">\n                    <div class=\"fr\"><span class=\"fr__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">통제가능성</span><span class=\"fr__w\" data-kg-role=\"label\">20%</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"fr\"><span class=\"fr__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">측정가능성</span><span class=\"fr__w\" data-kg-role=\"label\">20%</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"fr\"><span class=\"fr__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">이해용이성</span><span class=\"fr__w\" data-kg-role=\"label\">20%</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"fr\"><span class=\"fr__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">비중복성</span><span class=\"fr__w\" data-kg-role=\"label\">20%</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"fr\"><span class=\"fr__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">신뢰성</span><span class=\"fr__w\" data-kg-role=\"label\">20%</span></div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flsum\" data-kg-role=\"body2\">항목별 점수 부여 후 합산 — 두 평가를 통과한 지표만 다음 단계로 이관</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ================= 우 ================= -->\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"kg-subtopic\">필터링 판정과 지표 영역 구분</div>\n        <div class=\"col__b\">\n          <div class=\"mtx\">\n\n            <div class=\"card\">\n              <div class=\"card__h\">\n                <span class=\"card__n\" data-kg-role=\"num\">3</span>\n                <span class=\"card__t\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">지표 존치 판정</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"card__b\">\n                <div class=\"svgbox\">\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 250 240\" data-kg-lib=\"quad-scatter\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n                    <g stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" fill=\"none\">\n                      <path d=\"M137 10 V204\"></path><path d=\"M30 107 H244\"></path>\n                    </g>\n                    <g stroke=\"var(--ink-navy)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M30 10 V204 H244\"></path></g>\n                    <g fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\">\n                      <path d=\"M26 10 L30 2 L34 10 z\"></path><path d=\"M244 200 L252 204 L244 208 z\"></path>\n                    </g>\n                    <g font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-500)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                      <text x=\"18\" y=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">高</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"204\" text-anchor=\"middle\">低</text>\n                      <text x=\"32\" y=\"219\">低</text><text x=\"242\" y=\"219\" text-anchor=\"end\">高</text>\n                    </g>\n                    <text data-slot=\"axisY\" x=\"10\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\" transform=\"rotate(-90 10 107)\">성과 효과성</text>\n                    <text data-slot=\"axisX\" x=\"137\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">측정·관리 용이성</text>\n                    <g font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                      <text data-slot=\"qTL\" x=\"83\" y=\"26\" fill=\"var(--ink-500)\">보완</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"qTR\" x=\"191\" y=\"26\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\">유지</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"qBL\" x=\"83\" y=\"123\" fill=\"var(--ink-500)\">삭제</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"qBR\" x=\"191\" y=\"123\" fill=\"var(--ink-500)\">유보</text>\n                    </g>\n                    <g fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\">\n                      <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"45\" r=\"9\"></circle><circle cx=\"216\" cy=\"76\" r=\"9\"></circle><circle cx=\"174\" cy=\"62\" r=\"9\"></circle>\n                      <circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"48\" r=\"9\"></circle><circle cx=\"102\" cy=\"80\" r=\"9\"></circle>\n                      <circle cx=\"192\" cy=\"145\" r=\"9\"></circle><circle cx=\"212\" cy=\"174\" r=\"9\"></circle>\n                      <circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"158\" r=\"9\"></circle><circle cx=\"104\" cy=\"184\" r=\"9\"></circle>\n                    </g>\n                    <g font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                      <text data-slot=\"p1\" x=\"200\" y=\"49\">1</text><text data-slot=\"p2\" x=\"216\" y=\"80\">4</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"p3\" x=\"174\" y=\"66\">9</text><text data-slot=\"p4\" x=\"72\" y=\"52\">3</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"p5\" x=\"102\" y=\"84\">2</text><text data-slot=\"p6\" x=\"192\" y=\"149\">7</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"p7\" x=\"212\" y=\"178\">8</text><text data-slot=\"p8\" x=\"74\" y=\"162\">10</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"p9\" x=\"104\" y=\"188\">13</text>\n                    </g>\n                  </svg>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"lg\">\n                  <div class=\"lg__r\"><span class=\"lg__q\" data-kg-role=\"label\">유지</span><span class=\"lg__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">효과성·용이성 모두 확보 — <b>현행 산식 유지</b></span></div>\n                  <div class=\"lg__r\"><span class=\"lg__q lg__q--g\" data-kg-role=\"label\">보완</span><span class=\"lg__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">효과성은 확보, 측정 방법 재설계</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"lg__r\"><span class=\"lg__q lg__q--g\" data-kg-role=\"label\">유보</span><span class=\"lg__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">차기 평가주기까지 관찰 지표로 전환</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"lg__r\"><span class=\"lg__q lg__q--g\" data-kg-role=\"label\">삭제</span><span class=\"lg__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">지표 목록에서 제외하고 사유 기록</span></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card\">\n              <div class=\"card__h\">\n                <span class=\"card__n\" data-kg-role=\"num\">4</span>\n                <span class=\"card__t\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">지표 영역 구분</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"card__b\">\n                <div class=\"svgbox\">\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 250 240\" data-kg-lib=\"quad-scatter\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n                    <g stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" fill=\"none\">\n                      <path d=\"M137 10 V204\"></path><path d=\"M30 107 H244\"></path>\n                    </g>\n                    <g stroke=\"var(--ink-navy)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M30 10 V204 H244\"></path></g>\n                    <g fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\">\n                      <path d=\"M26 10 L30 2 L34 10 z\"></path><path d=\"M244 200 L252 204 L244 208 z\"></path>\n                    </g>\n                    <g font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-500)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                      <text x=\"18\" y=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">高</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"204\" text-anchor=\"middle\">低</text>\n                      <text x=\"32\" y=\"219\">低</text><text x=\"242\" y=\"219\" text-anchor=\"end\">高</text>\n                    </g>\n                    <text data-slot=\"axisY\" x=\"10\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\" transform=\"rotate(-90 10 107)\">전략적 중요도</text>\n                    <text data-slot=\"axisX\" x=\"137\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">조직 영향도</text>\n                    <g font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                      <text data-slot=\"qTL\" x=\"83\" y=\"26\" fill=\"var(--ink-500)\">Ⅱ 잠재적 선택</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"qTR\" x=\"191\" y=\"26\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\">Ⅰ 전략적 내재화</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"qBL\" x=\"83\" y=\"123\" fill=\"var(--ink-500)\">Ⅲ 비핵심 업무</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"qBR\" x=\"191\" y=\"123\" fill=\"var(--ink-500)\">Ⅳ 기관운영 필수</text>\n                    </g>\n                    <g fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\">\n                      <circle cx=\"196\" cy=\"47\" r=\"9\"></circle><circle cx=\"216\" cy=\"80\" r=\"9\"></circle><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"62\" r=\"9\"></circle>\n                      <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"50\" r=\"9\"></circle><circle cx=\"106\" cy=\"84\" r=\"9\"></circle>\n                      <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"146\" r=\"9\"></circle><circle cx=\"178\" cy=\"176\" r=\"9\"></circle>\n                      <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"152\" r=\"9\"></circle><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"182\" r=\"9\"></circle>\n                    </g>\n                    <g font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                      <text data-slot=\"p1\" x=\"196\" y=\"51\">1</text><text data-slot=\"p2\" x=\"216\" y=\"84\">2</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"p3\" x=\"170\" y=\"66\">4</text><text data-slot=\"p4\" x=\"80\" y=\"54\">9</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"p5\" x=\"106\" y=\"88\">13</text><text data-slot=\"p6\" x=\"200\" y=\"150\">3</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"p7\" x=\"178\" y=\"180\">7</text><text data-slot=\"p8\" x=\"70\" y=\"156\">8</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"p9\" x=\"100\" y=\"186\">10</text>\n                    </g>\n                  </svg>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"lg\">\n                  <div class=\"lg__r\"><span class=\"lg__q\" data-kg-role=\"label\">Ⅰ</span><span class=\"lg__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">전략 내재화 — <b>전사 대표지표로 배치</b></span></div>\n                  <div class=\"lg__r\"><span class=\"lg__q lg__q--g\" data-kg-role=\"label\">Ⅱ</span><span class=\"lg__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">잠재적 선택 — 본부 단위 지표로 운용</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"lg__r\"><span class=\"lg__q lg__q--g\" data-kg-role=\"label\">Ⅳ</span><span class=\"lg__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">기관운영 필수 — 관리지표로 상시 점검</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"lg__r\"><span class=\"lg__q lg__q--g\" data-kg-role=\"label\">Ⅲ</span><span class=\"lg__t\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">비핵심 업무 — 부서 내부 관리로 이관</span></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"evsys\">\n      <div class=\"kg-ghd\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">확정 지표와 개인 평가체계 연계</div>\n      <div class=\"evsys__b\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"ev__k\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">근무실적평가</div>\n          <div class=\"ev__v\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">내부평가편람의 직무계획 대비 실적을 평가</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"ev__k\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">다면평가</div>\n          <div class=\"ev__v\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">직무수행능력·태도·품성·윤리의식·청렴도를 평가</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"ev__k\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">경력평가</div>\n          <div class=\"ev__v\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">근무한 기간을 기준으로 평가</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"ev__k\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">교육평가</div>\n          <div class=\"ev__v\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">필수 교육과정의 이수 결과를 평가</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"ev__k\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">가점</div>\n          <div class=\"ev__v\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">창의혁신 제안, 교육훈련 우수자, 기피부서 근무</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer class=\"kg-footer\">\n    <span class=\"kg-footer__src\">JDC 중장기 경영전략체계 진단 및 수립 — 성과관리체계 재설계 및 성과지표 필터링 방안</span>\n    <span class=\"kg-footer__page\">41</span>\n    <span class=\"kg-footer__logo\"><img src=\"/kg/assets/keynes-group-logo.png\" alt=\"Keynes Group\"></span>\n  </footer>\n</section>",
    "css": ".main{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;min-height:0;margin-top:10px;}\n  .col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;}\n  .col__b{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;gap:9px;}\n\n  .card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);\n    border-radius:4px;background:#fff;min-height:0;overflow:hidden;}\n  .card__h{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:5px 10px;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2C5184,#1F497D);color:#fff;}\n  .card__n{flex:0 0 auto;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);\n    border-radius:3px;padding:2px 7px;}\n  .card__t{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;}\n  .card__b{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;padding:6px 9px;gap:5px;}\n  .card__b svg{width:100%;height:100%;}\n  .svgbox{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}\n\n  /* 2단 평가 */\n  .filters{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px;min-height:0;}\n  .fl{display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);\n    border-radius:4px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;min-height:0;}\n  .fl__h{font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:4px 6px;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#5A86BE,#4F81BD);}\n  .fl__b{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-evenly;\n    gap:2px;padding:4px 6px;min-height:0;}\n  .fr{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;}\n  .fr__t{flex:1;font-size:14px;line-height:1.1;color:var(--ink-900);background:var(--neutral-050);\n    border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-radius:3px;padding:2px 7px;}\n  .fr__w{flex:0 0 42px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy-800);\n    background:var(--blue-050);border:1px solid var(--blue-300);border-radius:3px;\n    text-align:center;padding:2px 0;}\n  .flsum{flex:0 0 auto;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;text-align:center;\n    background:var(--navy-800);border-radius:3px;padding:4px 8px;line-height:1.2;}\n\n  /* 매트릭스 카드 2개 */\n  .mtx{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px;min-height:0;}\n  .lg{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;}\n  .lg__r{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;}\n  .lg__q{flex:0 0 30px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;background:var(--navy-800);\n    border-radius:3px;text-align:center;padding:3px 0;}\n  .lg__q--g{background:var(--neutral-300);color:var(--ink-navy);}\n  .lg__t{flex:1;font-size:14px;line-height:1.15;color:var(--ink-700);}\n  .lg__t b{color:var(--navy-800);}\n\n  /* 평가체계 띠 */\n  .evsys{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-top:8px;}\n  .evsys__b{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:8px;padding:9px;\n    border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-top:0;border-radius:0 0 4px 4px;background:#fff;}\n  .ev__k{font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy-800);margin-bottom:4px;\n    padding-bottom:3px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--blue-300);}\n  .ev__v{font-size:14px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--ink-700);}",
